================================================================================
1. ORIGIN AND MODIFICATIONS
================================================================================

Required by Apache License 2.0, section 4(b) and 4(c).

This work is derived from the Redmi K70E / POCO X6 Pro 5G (duchamp) device tree:

    https://github.com/mt6897-devs/device_xiaomi_duchamp
    Copyright (C) 2025 The LineageOS Project
    Licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0

Both devices use the MediaTek Dimensity 8300 (MT6897) platform.

The upstream git history is preserved in this repository. Commits inherited
from duchamp keep their original authorship and commit messages; they are
prefixed "duchamp:" and are attributable through `git log`.

The files in this tree have been modified from their upstream form. Measured
on 2026-09-14 against duchamp at commit 074807a (branch lineage-23.2), and
disregarding the device-name rename:

    - 53 files added that do not exist upstream
    - 30 upstream files removed
    - 41 upstream files modified
    - 58 upstream files unmodified

Substantially rewritten or newly authored components include, among others:

    sensors/UdfpsSensorSubHal.{cpp,h}      new
    parts/src/.../telephony/ImsHealService.kt          new
    parts/src/.../display/RefreshRateHealService.kt    new
    parts/src/.../display/AodService.kt                new
    parts/src/.../touch/TouchFeatureWrapper.kt         new
    parts/src/.../touch/TouchGestureService.kt         new
    overlay/, overlay-lineage/, rro_overlays/          new
    patches/                                           new
    degas.xml                                          new
    udfps/UdfpsHandler.cpp                 rewritten
    proprietary-files.txt                  regenerated for this device
    vendor.prop, device.mk, BoardConfig.mk substantially modified

Components carried over from duchamp with little or no change include most
of the audio HAL wrapper (audio/ — two headers patched, the rest untouched),
parts of the SELinux policy (sepolicy/), and
parts/src/.../display/{ColorService,DisplayFeatureWrapper}.kt.


